    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE RESILIENT AND KEEP GOING!</h2>It's about Trial and Error. Show your resilience by passing all 20 random Questions and Riddles before your Time runs out, or admit to your weakness and surrender. It's your choice. Do you have what it takes?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908150/extras/905e17a52798e94ddcb26e214a653bb7.poster.avif?t=1713554930\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908150/extras/905e17a52798e94ddcb26e214a653bb7.webm?t=1713554930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908150/extras/905e17a52798e94ddcb26e214a653bb7.mp4?t=1713554930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WATCH THE STOPWATCH!</h2>How long will you take to beat the game? How long you take will be recorded. You can slack off and take your time if you want to, or you can rush trough the trials and speerun it. The choice is yours. Either way, the Stopwatch is counting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908150/extras/25d109726bb4fdd07ed778e8f9d4c6ad.avif?t=1713554930\" width=640 height=240 /></span><br><br>*This game contains mature content, such as implied nudity",
